WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:06.290
Here’s Sijil. Your documents and their renewal dates, together,
so you know what needs attention.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:13.050
Add a license, contract, or permit. Keep the file and its expiry
date in the same record.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:19.770
Then set a reminder. Notifications give you time to renew,
before a deadline becomes a problem.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:26.170
The dashboard shows what’s overdue and what’s coming up. Start
with the items that need attention.

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:32.570
Need a document? Search the list, check its status, and choose
Renew when you’re ready.
